    "checks": [
      "All eight client components bind original shared instances/info",
      "Original ownership and click queries",
      "Original configured/mutable reward and periodicity lookups",
      "Native component binding identity and lifecycle rebinding",
      "Entity index/shared state/client container/loading/four-statue regression"
    ]
  },
  "limitations": [
    "WorldStageInput, award hook, radar and remaining root/prefab components require migration. Level projections expose native state; original level formula and player parser/session bindings are not replaced or claimed validated. Formal native prefab loading, map input/UI/save, full ProjectTools.Validate and Windows Player remain pending."
